${sharp}${sharp} Build

From the generated workspace directory:

```bash
cd ./generated_sample_template_package/${rosParam.packageName}/cpp/template
colcon build --merge-install --symlink-install --packages-select ${rosParam.packageName}
source install/setup.bash
```

${sharp}${sharp} Run

```bash
ros2 launch ${rosParam.packageName} ${rosParam.nodeName}.launch.py
```

${sharp}${sharp} Lifecycle Operation

This package generates a ROS 2 Lifecycle node. After launch, configure and activate it:

```bash
ros2 lifecycle get /${rosParam.nodeName}
ros2 lifecycle set /${rosParam.nodeName} configure
ros2 lifecycle set /${rosParam.nodeName} activate
```

To stop active publishers and timers:

```bash
ros2 lifecycle set /${rosParam.nodeName} deactivate
```

